<title>TURKEY: TURK TRAKYA CAM 9-MTH PROFITS UP 19 PCT.</title>
<headline>TURK TRAKYA CAM 9-MTH PROFITS UP 19 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan-Sept 1996 provisional</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)	  305.39  vs     683.50</p>
<p>    Net profit			 2,382.03  vs   2,003.50</p>
<p>    Net sales			  9,856.62  vs   5,720.76</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 3,313.32  vs   2,462.22</p>
<p>    Exceptional income		 918.60  vs     246.28</p>
<p>    Interest paid			997.32  vs     349.86</p>
<p>    Extraordinary expense	    630.28  vs	46.56</p>
<p>    Total debts			8,149.48  vs   2,552.59</p>
<p>    Equity			    13,199.78  vs   7,258.95</p>
<p>    Capital			    7,800.00  vs   2,931.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Trakya Cam Sanayii A.S. produces flat glass and glass used in motor vehicles as part of Turkey's glass and glassware giant T.Sise ve Cam Fabrikalar A.S..</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 79.3 percent year-on-year consumer price inflation in September.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
